<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: #f9fafb; padding: 24px;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
  <tr><td style="padding: 32px 32px 24px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; color: #111827;">Approval Request — Contingency Removal</h2>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding: 0 32px 24px; color: #374151; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <p>Hello {{agentName}},</p>
    <p>Your transaction coordinator is requesting your approval to send <strong>contingency removal documents</strong> for <strong>{{propertyAddress}}</strong> to the buyer for signature.</p>
    <p>Please review and confirm whether you approve:</p>
    <div style="margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{approvalUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #1d4ed8; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">Review &amp; Respond</a>
    </div>
    <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px;">This link takes you to the transaction in MyTC.</p>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding: 16px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px;">Transaction #{{transactionId}}</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
